# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in. Never commit a filled copy: `.env*` is
# ignored and only this template is tracked.
#
# Where waitlist signups go. A Google Apps Script web app `/exec` URL.
# Leave it empty and the address is stored in the visitor's browser only, and
# the dialog says exactly that.
#
# Setup instructions: docs/setup/waitlist-apps-script.js
#
# Vite inlines VITE_* at build time, so the site must be rebuilt after this
# changes. This is a public value by design — it is a write-only endpoint with
# no secret in it — but anyone can post to it, so keep the Sheet private.
VITE_WAITLIST_WEBHOOK_URL=